msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Caught myself a big fish today, so I'm treatin' myself with a glass o' "
"Tantakatan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Ooh, I've heard'a that. That's that perilla stuff, right? I could go for a "
"cup'a that right now with some karaage and fresh sashimi... mmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Now that's a good idea, right there. That Tantakatan stuff is so tasty, you "
"can down a bottle in a coupl'a minutes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"My daughter's a fan, too. She just got to the drinkin' age and she just "
"loves makin' cocktails with Tantakatan and fruit juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Drinkin' with your daughter? Well, doesn't that sound peachy. I just drink "
"the stuff alone, though maybe I could get the wife to drink it with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "(Tantakatan, huh? I should remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

